WEBVTT

00:00.570 --> 00:05.330
When you change, don't you think something 
in bright red would be better than orange?

00:05.330 --> 00:07.720
Well, you should pick a color you like,

00:05.730 --> 00:10.310
I was told the number of seats for the 
Delbaran royal family hasn't been decided.

00:07.720 --> 00:10.970
but it would be good to include 
Astarl's royal color somewhere.

00:10.310 --> 00:11.690
Have you heard anything about it?

00:10.970 --> 00:14.950
Lady Leticia Dorman, have you 
memorized the wedding program yet?

00:11.690 --> 00:14.940
I can't imagine there's been 
a limit placed on them...

00:14.950 --> 00:19.220
You must perform flawlessly so as to 
not tarnish the name of the royal family.

00:14.950 --> 00:20.810
Lady Leticia, for dessert, I was told you 
want something sentimental to you,

00:19.220 --> 00:23.840
Missus, we've received confirmation on the
number and size of the floral arrangements,

00:20.810 --> 00:24.960
but without further instruction, I'm having 
trouble envisioning something appropriate.

00:23.840 --> 00:28.160
but I am not in charge, so I am not sure 
how to respond. What should I do?

00:24.960 --> 00:28.160
If it's something flower-shaped, 
then what kind of flower?

00:28.160 --> 00:29.760
The person in charge is not here...

00:28.160 --> 00:33.560
My lady, please add your signature 
to the invitations from the Dorman family.

00:29.760 --> 00:33.560
Hey, is Maria gonna wear a dress too or what?

00:33.560 --> 00:36.010
That's the only part of this I'm excited about.

00:33.900 --> 00:38.790
Oh, right. The prince said that he wanted 
a portrait of you in your wedding dress.

00:36.010 --> 00:37.610
You'd better make sure.

00:37.610 --> 00:41.730
You're gonna be crown princess, right? 
So you got the authority, right?

00:38.790 --> 00:41.730
He told me to ask you 
which artist you would prefer.

00:41.730 --> 00:44.820
Is this the correct arrangement 
for the guest seating at the chapel?

00:44.820 --> 00:47.520
I've received complaints that
the Delbaran seats are wrong

00:44.820 --> 00:48.620
We've had questions about 
the servants' official attire.

00:47.520 --> 00:50.990
and that guests in back won't be able to see.

00:48.620 --> 00:50.990
Are guards expected to be
in ceremonial dress as well?

00:50.990 --> 00:52.250
Shall I shut them up?

00:50.990 --> 00:54.460
Many are saying that they 
do not want the colors to overlap...

00:52.250 --> 00:54.460
I bring a message from Queen Laura.

00:54.460 --> 00:58.720
Clarke! You got a letter of congratulations 
from the kingdom of Delbaran.

00:54.460 --> 01:01.750
Prince Matthias's etiquette training is about
to begin and your presence is requested.

00:58.720 --> 01:00.620
Look it over when you get a chance.

01:00.620 --> 01:01.750
What's wrong? You seem down.

01:01.750 --> 01:06.360
Prince Clarke! What kind of dessert 
is sentimental to you?

01:02.120 --> 01:04.760
Do you think you have the time for it?

01:04.760 --> 01:10.080
Prince Clarke, the person managing 
the reception is completely ignoring my advice.

01:06.360 --> 01:13.150
Lady Leticia told me she has so many 
ideas she can't narrow it down to one.

01:10.080 --> 01:14.910
Shocking that someone can doubt the sublime 
taste of someone so sublimely beautiful...

01:13.150 --> 01:17.290
At this rate, I don't know how I'll find 
the inspiration to do this.

01:14.910 --> 01:17.290
Could you put me in charge 
of the reception instead?

01:17.290 --> 01:17.980
Prince Clarke?

01:17.980 --> 01:18.820
Prince Clarke!

01:18.490 --> 01:19.370
Prince Clarke!

01:19.070 --> 01:20.370
Prince Clarke!

01:19.730 --> 01:20.420
Prince Clarke!

01:20.610 --> 01:21.730
<i>I want to escape.</i>

01:21.730 --> 01:22.620
Leticia?

01:21.730 --> 01:22.620
Missus?

01:22.620 --> 01:23.140
Lady Leticia!

01:23.140 --> 01:23.690
Lady Leticia?

01:23.690 --> 01:24.330
Hey, runt!

01:23.690 --> 01:25.220
Lady Leticia!

01:24.330 --> 01:25.580
Lady Leticia?

01:25.580 --> 01:30.990
Enough! I want to escape!

03:10.150 --> 03:12.500
She sure is feisty again today.

03:13.060 --> 03:15.470
This is no laughing matter, Father.

03:15.470 --> 03:19.710
Oh, goodness. Perhaps you should 
try to relax a little more.

03:20.320 --> 03:23.940
I would like to, but I simply
 have too much to do.

03:24.310 --> 03:29.540
So it goes. Weddings are big events, 
even when you aren't royalty.

03:29.540 --> 03:31.330
It certainly seems that way.

03:31.330 --> 03:31.990
Oh!

03:31.990 --> 03:32.520
Oh!

03:38.650 --> 03:40.580
It looks like she got caught.

03:41.630 --> 03:44.940
I'm sure she thinks she'll get away someday.

03:45.980 --> 03:50.580
Father, have you ever imagined what life 
would be like if you weren't royalty?

03:51.260 --> 03:55.360
Say, instead of being king, you lived 
in the countryside with the woman you loved,

03:55.360 --> 03:59.260
working the fields and 
living a modest but earnest life?

04:08.900 --> 04:11.230
I'm so busy, I'm so busy!

04:14.900 --> 04:16.070
Hmm?

04:19.480 --> 04:20.610
What's this?

04:23.570 --> 04:27.040
Clarke, I can tell you're 
very serious about her.

04:27.620 --> 04:28.620
Yes.

04:29.650 --> 04:31.640
She is more important to me than anything.

04:32.170 --> 04:36.430
If it would make her happy, I would 
renounce my claim to the throne.

04:43.740 --> 04:46.940
Clarke is giving up his claim to the throne?!

04:46.940 --> 04:48.490
Dummy, dummy! Shh!

04:48.490 --> 04:51.120
Not so loud, Prince Louis!

04:51.120 --> 04:53.580
There's no way that'd ever happen.

04:53.580 --> 04:57.550
Listen, you. You could end up 
on the guillotine for this.

04:58.280 --> 05:02.410
But I really heard him say it! 
With my own two ears!

05:03.150 --> 05:05.360
That makes it even harder to believe.

05:05.360 --> 05:07.370
The wedding's around the corner!

05:07.370 --> 05:09.220
But I'm telling you! It's the truth!

05:09.220 --> 05:11.920
He said he'd give up the throne 
for Lady Leticia!

05:12.680 --> 05:13.760
Hmm...

05:14.660 --> 05:15.790
It can't be!

05:15.790 --> 05:20.050
Prince Clarke would abandon his position 
and prestige for the missus?

05:20.050 --> 05:24.700
But if he does, you won't have 
to work here anymore, right?

05:24.700 --> 05:29.770
And then I would be happy 
to pay for your freedom, Maria.

05:30.030 --> 05:33.720
Because I... Because I really am full of

05:33.720 --> 05:36.200
love... love... love for—

05:36.520 --> 05:41.050
What should I do? Would it be best 
if I asked someone for advice?

05:41.050 --> 05:46.960
Personally, my primary concern is their 
happiness, so perhaps it's best for me

05:46.960 --> 05:51.610
to stay out of their way and support them 
secretly from the shadows.

05:50.500 --> 05:51.610
Uh...

05:51.610 --> 05:53.960
<i>She isn't listening! 
She isn't even looking at me!</i>

05:54.780 --> 05:55.820
Maria?

05:55.820 --> 05:58.860
I will support the two of them, 
no matter what happens!

05:58.860 --> 06:00.020
Huh?

06:00.020 --> 06:03.820
Thank you very much, Prince Louis. 
I am glad that you informed me.

06:03.820 --> 06:07.050
Heh. B-But the other thing...

06:07.050 --> 06:09.160
All for the missus and Prince Clarke!

06:09.160 --> 06:10.260
Oh, yeah!

06:10.850 --> 06:13.350
What? What exactly do you mean?

06:13.350 --> 06:16.410
I simply find it all so romantic!

06:18.130 --> 06:21.270
So I have decided to do 
what I can to assist them.

06:21.270 --> 06:23.520
What do you imagine they would need first?

06:23.520 --> 06:26.030
I came to ask for your advice, Miss Lily.

06:26.030 --> 06:27.410
Well, let's see...

06:28.140 --> 06:31.070
Perhaps the financial means 
to survive on their own for a while.

06:31.070 --> 06:32.250
But Maria,

06:32.940 --> 06:36.750
we are in no position to take action 
without our master's knowledge.

06:36.750 --> 06:37.900
The means...

06:38.270 --> 06:39.570
The means...

06:40.130 --> 06:41.270
I've got it!

06:41.270 --> 06:42.270
Maria?

06:42.910 --> 06:45.070
A romantic escape together?

06:45.070 --> 06:48.170
It appears they have been 
making preparations for one.

06:48.170 --> 06:52.050
I can't imagine those two have the life 
skills they'll need to get by on their own.

06:52.390 --> 06:56.340
They've been corresponding 
with Lord Dale of Delbaran recently

06:56.340 --> 06:59.320
and seem most curious 
about the life of an adventurer.

06:59.320 --> 07:02.150
Perhaps they are consulting him for advice.

07:02.150 --> 07:05.440
Perhaps, but it still comes down to the money.

07:05.970 --> 07:09.100
If they run off with a royal 
treasure or two to sell,

07:09.100 --> 07:10.850
I wonder if that would fetch enough.

07:10.850 --> 07:15.710
I do wish that I could be of help, 
but I am unable to act of my own accord

07:15.710 --> 07:18.680
without orders from Lord Nadir 
or Lady Leticia.

07:18.680 --> 07:22.250
That is why I wanted to consult 
with you, Lady Brianna.

07:22.250 --> 07:24.840
I wonder if Nadir knows anything about this.

07:25.300 --> 07:29.470
If he did, I suspect he'd do everything 
in his power to stop them.

07:29.470 --> 07:31.570
So she isn't even telling family?

07:33.090 --> 07:35.430
That must mean she's really serious about it.

07:35.430 --> 07:37.600
Yes. It would seem so.

07:37.960 --> 07:39.330
All right, Lily.

07:39.330 --> 07:42.280
I'll roll up my sleeves and 
do what I can to help them.

07:42.280 --> 07:44.730
Thank you, Lady Brianna.

07:46.440 --> 07:50.290
Did you hear about the crazy scheme 
they have planned for the wedding?

07:50.290 --> 07:53.210
Oh my! Is this another one 
of your little secrets?

07:53.210 --> 07:54.880
What could it be?

07:55.330 --> 07:59.130
Get this. There's a big surprise 
at the end of the ceremony.

08:01.130 --> 08:02.380
You'd better not tell anyone!

08:05.300 --> 08:06.340
What?!

08:06.340 --> 08:08.570
Lady Leticia and Prince Clarke together?

08:08.570 --> 08:11.300
They're going to playact
 running off, hand in hand?

08:11.300 --> 08:15.470
They're even swiping a royal 
treasure for show. A necklace!

08:15.470 --> 08:16.960
Oh, how exciting!

08:16.960 --> 08:19.390
It sounds like an adventure novel!

08:19.390 --> 08:23.170
Stealing a royal treasure 
in order to run away together!

08:23.680 --> 08:28.150
But anyone who doesn't realize 
it's just for show might try to stop them.

08:28.570 --> 08:33.470
That's why I'd like you to assist me 
in securing an escape route for them.

08:33.470 --> 08:34.950
Would you be willing to help?

08:35.300 --> 08:37.830
Of course! It'd be my pleasure.

08:37.830 --> 08:41.380
Since we know in advance, 
we should be able to help a bunch.

08:41.660 --> 08:46.540
Thank you, Isabella and Catherine. 
We're gonna have our hands full for a while!

08:46.540 --> 08:48.890
All right then, I'd best be getting back.

08:48.890 --> 08:50.060
Have a lovely day.

08:52.090 --> 08:53.920
Have a lovely day!

08:54.760 --> 08:55.720
What fun!

08:55.720 --> 08:56.810
This is so neat!

08:57.210 --> 08:59.940
Did you call for me, young master?

09:00.440 --> 09:04.680
I have a list of guests from House Dorman
 who are helping with the wedding.

09:04.680 --> 09:06.620
Would you mind reviewing it for me?

09:06.620 --> 09:08.300
As you wish.

09:14.910 --> 09:16.290
Something wrong, Lily?

09:17.370 --> 09:20.290
Well then, young master, I must be on my way!

09:20.770 --> 09:22.620
Oh dear, am I busy!

09:23.650 --> 09:24.750
What's that about?

09:26.310 --> 09:30.450
Duke Neil, have you heard about 
Lady Leticia and the prince?

09:30.450 --> 09:32.890
What sorts of rumors are you spreading today?

09:32.890 --> 09:36.560
Hey, Isabella! 
We were told to keep it a secret!

09:36.990 --> 09:41.760
But it's Lady Leticia and 
Prince Clarke's big romantic getaway!

09:41.760 --> 09:43.950
I simply have to tell somebody!

09:43.950 --> 09:47.560
Besides, there's no way Duke Neil 
doesn't already know.

09:47.560 --> 09:48.900
Right, Duke Neil?

09:51.710 --> 09:53.990
Well, of course I already knew.

09:53.990 --> 09:57.240
You are on their side, after all.

09:57.640 --> 10:01.370
They're even stealing 
a royal treasure, a necklace!

10:01.370 --> 10:02.880
Are they really?

10:03.330 --> 10:04.830
Do you mean <i>that</i> necklace?

10:04.830 --> 10:07.860
You know which one it is, Duke Neil?

10:08.160 --> 10:11.990
Yes. It was a gift from Delbaran 
to the kingdom of Astarl

10:11.990 --> 10:15.260
as a symbol of their friendship.

10:15.260 --> 10:16.730
Wow, this is big!

10:16.730 --> 10:17.510
Yes!

10:17.840 --> 10:18.950
Hmm...

10:20.420 --> 10:22.850
Why did you need to see me right away?

10:23.440 --> 10:24.810
What are you hiding?

10:24.810 --> 10:27.070
N-Nothing.

10:27.400 --> 10:29.590
I'm not hiding a thing from you.

10:41.620 --> 10:42.830
Tell me.

10:44.710 --> 10:47.200
There's nothing to tell! Move!

10:51.850 --> 10:53.880
Wh-What is going on?

10:54.470 --> 10:59.220
I have a question regarding the necklace 
that Delbaran gave to Astarl.

11:00.020 --> 11:03.910
Huh? Right now? 
It just sounds like Clarke really likes it.

11:03.910 --> 11:06.600
Do you mean to say he wants it?

11:06.900 --> 11:11.860
Well, it is a royal treasure in Astarl. 
We plan to discuss it with King Morris later.

11:11.860 --> 11:14.280
Even knowing that it's a royal treasure?

11:14.280 --> 11:16.110
My goodness. How scandalous!

11:17.530 --> 11:19.890
We have to take care of it before the wedding.

11:19.890 --> 11:21.270
It's practically upon us.

11:21.730 --> 11:23.500
You hadn't heard yet, Uncle?

11:23.500 --> 11:27.870
I haven't any more time to dally here. 
And Nathan, do stop calling me "uncle."

11:28.160 --> 11:30.840
Fine, Uncle Neil.

11:31.110 --> 11:34.070
We must also be prepared for anything.

11:34.070 --> 11:34.940
Yes.

11:35.330 --> 11:39.180
As far as village life goes, 
they should be able to manage, right?

11:39.180 --> 11:41.770
We are talking about 
the Lady and Prince Clarke.

11:41.770 --> 11:45.660
I'm sure they'll try to use some 
of their money for the villagers.

11:46.330 --> 11:48.850
You may be right. That sounds like them.

11:49.560 --> 11:53.480
We must be prepared to deal with 
any situation we find ourselves in in.

11:53.480 --> 11:56.910
Do you think we will face reproach 
for having helped them run away?

11:56.910 --> 11:58.250
Most likely.

11:58.250 --> 12:02.180
Regardless, I shall remain an ally 
to the missus and Prince Clarke.

12:02.790 --> 12:04.490
As shall I.

12:06.130 --> 12:07.230
Maria...

12:07.230 --> 12:08.380
Miss Lily...

12:10.170 --> 12:11.630
What was that?

12:12.090 --> 12:16.760
Stealing a royal treasure? 
Prince Clarke is like some kind of cat burglar!

12:16.760 --> 12:20.830
I guess that would make Lady Leticia 
something like a female bandit!

12:20.830 --> 12:22.190
How charming!

12:22.190 --> 12:26.190
May I ask what you two are discussing?

12:26.190 --> 12:29.620
Oh, just the little playact for the wedding.

12:29.620 --> 12:31.570
Haven't you heard, mistress?

12:31.570 --> 12:33.850
There is no such playacting planned!

12:33.850 --> 12:34.870
Huh?

12:38.270 --> 12:40.280
I have an incredibly bad feeling about this.

12:42.470 --> 12:44.530
Would you mind telling me more?

12:50.320 --> 12:51.670
Duke Neil.

12:51.670 --> 12:53.360
Oh, Lord Nadir.

12:53.360 --> 12:56.050
It's rare to find you in such a hurry.

12:56.410 --> 12:59.450
I heard all about it 
and simply could not sit still.

12:59.450 --> 13:02.300
Not that there is anything I can do.

13:03.790 --> 13:05.220
What are you talking about?

13:06.130 --> 13:07.140
Huh?

13:09.800 --> 13:15.040
Sebastian, have my years 
of hard work all been for naught?

13:15.040 --> 13:18.840
Miss Laila, I do not believe 
your efforts were wasted in the least.

13:20.240 --> 13:22.460
But what is this all about?

13:24.140 --> 13:25.660
My goodness.

13:26.210 --> 13:28.860
There, there. Please tell me everything.

13:28.860 --> 13:34.090
Prince Clarke is renouncing 
his claim to the throne...

13:34.930 --> 13:38.280
so he can run away with Lady Leticia!

13:38.280 --> 13:39.960
What did you just say?!

13:39.960 --> 13:41.580
It can't be!

13:44.790 --> 13:50.330
My one and only goal in life was 
to continue to serve Prince Clarke!

13:59.680 --> 14:01.240
Things sure are quiet.

14:01.240 --> 14:03.670
Careful, I might escape!

14:05.880 --> 14:11.290
At any rate, we mustn't take our eyes off 
of the lady until the wedding ceremony.

14:11.290 --> 14:12.450
Yes, you're right.

14:12.450 --> 14:16.000
I'm sure she's still preparing mentally, 
so we should be there for support.

14:16.000 --> 14:19.960
I've made the necessary arrangements, 
but what is there left to do?

14:19.960 --> 14:23.850
The wedding is so soon that there 
isn't much time left for anything else.

14:23.850 --> 14:28.580
So Clarke renounces his claim 
to the throne, and then what?

14:28.580 --> 14:32.920
Prince Matthias will take his place 
as first in line to the throne.

14:32.920 --> 14:38.400
King Morris is still very active, so I doubt 
relations with Delbaran will change much.

14:38.730 --> 14:43.100
Rumors usually turn out to be true anyway, 
so they're really useful in politics.

14:43.100 --> 14:46.640
But shouldn't we have helped 
keep it a secret this time?

14:46.640 --> 14:47.870
I wouldn't think so.

14:49.070 --> 14:51.210
Please wait, Lord Nadir!

14:51.210 --> 14:53.330
I need some answers. Answers!

14:53.330 --> 14:57.010
I want them to look me in the eye and 
tell me directly or I'll never be satisfied!

14:57.010 --> 15:01.840
I am sure we will be lonely, but wouldn't 
it be best to send them off with a smile?

15:02.380 --> 15:05.860
All right, now who is the 
source of this rumor?

15:07.890 --> 15:09.800
Don't all talk at once!

15:12.690 --> 15:14.770
Who is it?

15:15.720 --> 15:16.650
Slip...

15:19.890 --> 15:22.210
What's going on? I want an explanation!

15:22.210 --> 15:22.980
Okay!

15:23.270 --> 15:27.740
I overheard Prince Clarke 
talking with His Majesty.

15:28.300 --> 15:29.700
You had better not be lying.

15:30.020 --> 15:33.970
It's the truth! I heard him 
very clearly. Prince Clarke said,

15:33.970 --> 15:39.380
"If it would make her happy, 
I would renounce my claim to the throne."

15:39.380 --> 15:40.740
What is that supposed to mean?

15:40.740 --> 15:41.500
Oh!

15:46.320 --> 15:48.890
Where is Prince Clarke right now?

15:59.420 --> 16:00.810
Clarke.

16:00.810 --> 16:02.710
Are you sure about this?

16:02.710 --> 16:06.090
Yes. I stand firm in my decision.

16:06.090 --> 16:07.250
I see.

16:09.950 --> 16:13.160
Then we shall defer to your decision.

16:13.870 --> 16:15.530
I deeply appreciate it.

16:15.530 --> 16:20.340
Well, if that's that, then you have
 Delbaran's full cooperation.

16:20.340 --> 16:22.030
Thank you, Nathan.

16:29.630 --> 16:30.680
Lettie?

16:31.810 --> 16:37.390
Prince Clarke! What is all this about you 
renouncing your claim to the throne?!

16:38.230 --> 16:39.230
Huh?

16:39.620 --> 16:43.590
Didn't you tell me you wanted to 
uphold the peace for everyone here?

16:43.590 --> 16:45.900
Or was that all just a lie?

16:45.900 --> 16:49.990
Whatever the reason, why would you abandon 
the throne and run away <i>now</i>?

16:49.990 --> 16:53.740
The Prince Clarke I love 
would never be so cowardly!

17:02.340 --> 17:06.500
I can't believe you'd hide something 
so important from your future life partner.

17:06.500 --> 17:11.420
If you wanted to quit being prince, 
why couldn't you talk to me about it?

17:11.420 --> 17:12.220
Lettie...

17:12.220 --> 17:15.470
You know that I'd support you any way I could!

17:16.130 --> 17:17.510
Then I guess I'll tell you.

17:19.470 --> 17:22.620
What are you so happy about?! 
Can't you see how upset I am?

17:22.620 --> 17:25.080
What the heck is going on here?

17:25.080 --> 17:25.820
Huh?

17:26.190 --> 17:29.820
Oh dear. Would you two please calm down?

17:29.820 --> 17:33.070
It seems there must be some 
kind of misunderstanding.

17:33.620 --> 17:36.000
You'd better give her an explanation, Clarke.

17:36.000 --> 17:36.810
Yes.

17:37.670 --> 17:41.080
I wanted to discuss my 
feelings with my father.

17:44.040 --> 17:46.420
What is it that's troubling you?

17:47.140 --> 17:49.420
I wonder if Leticia is truly happy.

17:49.890 --> 17:54.220
She's forced to stay fenced in here 
just because I'm the crown prince.

17:54.680 --> 17:58.650
I wanted to be with Leticia so badly, 
I was willing to accept that.

18:00.420 --> 18:01.610
But not anymore.

18:02.570 --> 18:06.240
Clarke, I can tell you're 
very serious about her.

18:06.630 --> 18:07.440
Yes.

18:08.540 --> 18:10.560
She is more important to me than anything.

18:11.030 --> 18:15.220
If it would make her happy, 
I would renounce my claim to the throne.

18:19.620 --> 18:21.450
Leticia is trying her hardest.

18:21.970 --> 18:24.750
It would be unfair if I were 
any less committed than she is.

18:25.280 --> 18:29.180
So right now, I believe that sparing 
no effort to become a good king

18:29.180 --> 18:32.110
is my way of living up to 
her expectations of me.

18:32.510 --> 18:36.450
Wuh? Wait, then all this talk 
about renouncing the throne...

18:36.450 --> 18:38.140
Just a plain old misunderstanding.

18:39.520 --> 18:42.520
Lettie, you really are just 
the sweetest little thing.

18:44.100 --> 18:46.560
Astarl is always good for a laugh.

18:47.750 --> 18:52.030
I'm so embarrassed! I'm sorry!

18:50.580 --> 18:52.030
Ah, Lettie!

19:08.730 --> 19:10.210
Clarke.

19:14.660 --> 19:17.180
You'd better hurry and chase after her.

19:17.180 --> 19:19.640
Don't let a girl like that get away.

19:20.680 --> 19:21.700
Right!

19:36.420 --> 19:38.820
You've almost got it! Keep trying!

19:42.560 --> 19:44.320
Enough! I can't breathe!

19:44.320 --> 19:46.070
No, keep at it!

19:46.070 --> 19:49.170
This is a once-in-a-lifetime moment!
 Give it your all!

19:49.170 --> 19:50.320
Lady Leticia!

19:50.320 --> 19:51.500
You can do it!

19:51.500 --> 19:55.260
Missus, I'll make sure your big moment 
is the biggest moment ever!

19:55.260 --> 19:56.760
Here we go!

19:56.760 --> 19:58.920
One, two...

21:27.080 --> 21:30.160
Lettie, you're the most 
beautiful thing in all the world.

21:30.740 --> 21:33.440
You're very handsome yourself, Prince Clarke.

21:47.500 --> 21:49.560
Well, there's no escaping now!

23:19.920 --> 23:39.940
<b>Next Time</b>

23:20.040 --> 23:25.050
Good afternoon, everyone

23:20.920 --> 23:25.930
Our... first night

23:21.920 --> 23:26.930
What a sexy see-through negligee

23:22.920 --> 23:27.930
You're married and you're still causing trouble?

23:23.920 --> 23:28.930
Now we just need an heir

23:25.930 --> 23:30.930
Lettie, brudder, Mattie coming!

23:27.300 --> 23:32.310
Like uncle, like nephew

23:28.800 --> 23:33.810
This is awful! This is awful!

23:30.300 --> 23:35.310
All of those memories are precious

23:31.810 --> 23:36.810
Prince Clarke, is this really who we are?

23:37.270 --> 23:39.940
Well then, let's be on our way!
